316
35:26.970 --> 35:29.850
"Kaew, do my homework for me."

317
35:30.310 --> 35:33.270
"Kaew, go save a table for me."

318
35:35.030 --> 35:37.450
You've always just looked at me like a dog.

319
35:39.790 --> 35:40.570
What,

320
35:41.440 --> 35:47.480
can't you handle the fact that today a dog like me beat you?

321
35:48.000 --> 35:49.450
Do you actually believe what she's saying?

322
35:50.180 --> 35:51.850
Aren't you being too full of yourself?

323
35:52.910 --> 35:53.870
Fake an orgasm,

324
35:54.790 --> 35:56.330
she probably didn't say that just to you.

325
35:57.850 --> 35:58.760
Kie!

326
36:03.690 --> 36:07.490
Someone like you who would even steal a friend's wife.

327
36:08.120 --> 36:09.510
What right do you have to slap me?

328
36:09.830 --> 36:10.870
Why wouldn't I have the right?

329
36:12.150 --> 36:14.050
Pha and I were together before you even showed up!

330
36:14.920 --> 36:18.560
The one who stole Pha away was you, not me.

331
36:23.360 --> 36:27.590
That's not true! If you two were together first,

332
36:28.980 --> 36:30.360
why would Pha marry me?

333
36:30.400 --> 36:32.360
Why did she marry you?

334
36:33.610 --> 36:35.100
Because of money! Because you're rich!

335
36:35.620 --> 36:37.030
I just let Pha sleep with you

336
36:37.080 --> 36:39.030
so she could take your money

337
36:40.030 --> 36:44.090
and bring it back to me.

338
36:48.020 --> 36:49.510
You really are an idiot, aren't you?

339
36:49.890 --> 36:50.790
What are you laughing at?

340
36:50.840 --> 36:52.100
Have you gone mad?!

341
36:54.710 --> 36:58.030
Pha and I never registered our marriage,

342
36:59.180 --> 37:00.610
didn't she tell you?

343
37:03.700 --> 37:04.990
You stupid bitch.

344
37:05.720 --> 37:09.510
No matter how badly you want my fortune, you can't have it.

345
37:11.190 --> 37:12.730
I won’t register a marriage with anyone at all.

346
37:14.880 --> 37:17.450
You got played for free

347
37:19.080 --> 37:20.740
and then scammed out of my money.

348
37:21.530 --> 37:23.420
You are seriously stupid over and over again.

349
37:23.460 --> 37:24.140
Kie!

350
37:41.890 --> 37:44.160
That's enough, P'Kie. That's enough.

351
37:44.960 --> 37:47.600
Kaew Kaew!

352
37:47.860 --> 37:49.190
A bullshit friend like her

353
37:50.390 --> 37:51.770
deserves this.

354
37:52.000 --> 37:53.330
Kie, stop it.

355
37:55.730 --> 37:56.340
Let go!

356
37:57.250 --> 37:58.160
Kaew.

357
37:58.530 --> 37:59.240
Let go of me.

358
38:00.600 --> 38:01.440
Kaew!

359
38:01.750 --> 38:02.600
Awww.

360
38:02.890 --> 38:03.400
Come on.

361
38:07.100 --> 38:08.030
Kaew.

362
38:08.670 --> 38:09.970
Stop P’Kie.

363
38:10.030 --> 38:11.320
Stop it now.

364
38:11.370 --> 38:12.480
You're both as bad as each other.

365
38:12.530 --> 38:15.190
I regret ever trusting you.

366
38:16.630 --> 38:18.810
I shouldn't have been friends with a two-faced person like you.

367
38:18.860 --> 38:21.180
Do you think I actually wanted to be friends with someone like you, huh?

368
38:22.030 --> 38:23.530
A person like you

369
38:23.870 --> 38:27.080
has nothing good going for you besides money.

370
38:28.570 --> 38:29.880
If you were actually a good person,

371
38:30.150 --> 38:33.840
none of your wives would have betrayed you the way they do.

372
38:36.250 --> 38:37.860
Everyone who comes into your life

373
38:38.810 --> 38:41.200
is just two-faced with you anyway.

374
38:42.640 --> 38:45.340
You're just a walking ATM.

375
38:45.400 --> 38:46.210
Kaew!

376
38:46.460 --> 38:47.970
That's enough, Kaew.

377
38:48.000 --> 38:49.140
Let me go.

378
38:50.390 --> 38:54.710
Someone like kie needs to know what her true nature is really like.

379
38:57.540 --> 39:01.560
No wonder... not a single person wants to be genuine with you.

380
39:01.940 --> 39:05.710
Oh... acting like some high-and-mighty princess

381
39:05.750 --> 39:07.690
who gets whatever she wants and expects everyone to bend to you, huh?

382
39:07.720 --> 39:08.480
Kaew!

383
39:08.750 --> 39:12.380
Do you have any idea how sick and tired everyone is of you?

384
39:14.590 --> 39:16.840
Even though you never registered your marriage with anyone.

385
39:17.210 --> 39:19.930
I know that even if you wanted to,

386
39:19.980 --> 39:21.930
nobody would want to register a marriage with you anyway.

387
39:23.050 --> 39:24.260
What kind of person are you?

388
39:24.320 --> 39:26.320
Anyone you marry just ends up dead.

389
39:27.660 --> 39:31.840
Is this what you call having a husband-killer destiny?

390
39:32.830 --> 39:33.940
No, wait.

391
39:34.440 --> 39:37.500
It should be called a wife-devouring destiny, that's more accurate.

392
39:37.960 --> 39:39.090
You are a jinx!!

393
39:39.150 --> 39:40.540
Kaew Kaew

394
39:42.710 --> 39:44.260
Aunt Ros! Aunt Ros!

395
39:44.300 --> 39:46.190
Aunt Ros! Aunt Ros!

396
39:47.080 --> 39:47.810
Aunt Ros!

397
39:48.680 --> 39:51.030
Let's call an ambulance, just to be safe.

398
39:51.070 --> 39:52.090
No need.

399
39:52.950 --> 39:54.000
I’ll call it myself.

400
39:54.050 --> 39:55.370
All of you, just go back.

401
39:57.990 --> 39:58.870
Aunt Ros,

402
40:02.110 --> 40:05.250
I told you to go back! Go!

403
40:05.320 --> 40:06.280
Let's go, Kie.

404
40:06.670 --> 40:07.870
Vodka, let's go.

405
40:19.870 --> 40:20.630
Aunt Ros!

406
40:22.000 --> 40:22.930
Aunt Ros!

407
40:33.770 --> 40:34.770
Oh my god!

408
40:35.280 --> 40:37.880
Why do you bring trouble upon yourself every single day?!

409
40:37.930 --> 40:39.880
If your dad and Grandpa find out about this,

410
40:39.940 --> 40:42.820
I'm definitely going to get blamed for taking poor care of Kie.

411
40:43.150 --> 40:44.570
It’s okay, Mom.

412
40:44.630 --> 40:46.780
I’ll help clear things up with Dad for you.

413
40:47.840 --> 40:48.840
Thank you, Wine.

414
40:49.680 --> 40:50.990
And... and where is Kie?

415
40:51.720 --> 40:52.730
She's right over there.

416
40:52.760 --> 40:53.810
Did you bring everything here?

417
40:54.060 --> 40:55.140
Absolutely everything.

418
40:55.190 --> 40:58.520
Everything related to Ms. Kaew and Ms. Pha are here.

419
41:32.220 --> 41:33.120
Burn it all.

420
41:33.400 --> 41:34.810
Yes, Ms. Kie.

421
41:41.590 --> 41:44.720
Wow, did she really slap her right at her house?

422
41:45.580 --> 41:48.100
Yeah, she did.

423
41:48.150 --> 41:50.390
K’May told me about it right after the clinic's shareholders' meeting.

424
41:50.980 --> 41:54.540
K’May said she was so distressed she didn't know what to do.

425
41:54.910 --> 41:57.460
When I first heard it, I was shocked too.

426
41:58.800 --> 42:02.740
But from what you told me, those two have been best friends since childhood.

427
42:03.720 --> 42:04.810
It's such a shame.

428
42:08.100 --> 42:09.730
I just feel bad for Kie.

429
42:09.770 --> 42:11.680
No good deed goes unpunished with her.

430
42:22.510 --> 42:23.430
Hello?

431
42:25.090 --> 42:28.740
Hello. I'm Kie’s secretary.

432
42:28.790 --> 42:30.940
She gave me your Line contact.

433
42:31.010 --> 42:35.250
She would like to compensate you for taking her to the hospital.

434
42:35.740 --> 42:36.870
That's alright.

435
42:36.920 --> 42:38.480
I already told her it wasn't necessary.

436
42:39.090 --> 42:41.360
Oh, you really can't do that.

437
42:41.410 --> 42:48.030
She strictly instructed me that the money must be transferred to you.

438
42:48.750 --> 42:50.750
Are you okay with fifty thousand?

439
42:50.800 --> 42:51.890
I'm not okay with it.

440
42:51.940 --> 42:53.600
I won't take a single baht.

441
42:53.640 --> 42:55.130
I helped because I wanted to.

442
42:55.180 --> 42:57.660
Please tell your boss thank you very much,

443
42:57.860 --> 42:58.890
but no thanks.

444
42:58.950 --> 42:59.890
That's all, goodbye.

445
43:00.210 --> 43:02.210
Oh, don't hang up yet! Please...

446
43:03.370 --> 43:06.500
I'm begging you.

447
43:06.560 --> 43:08.880
If you don't take this money,

448
43:09.630 --> 43:11.880
I'm going to be in serious trouble.

449
43:12.050 --> 43:15.740
So please, just accept this money.

450
43:15.800 --> 43:16.850
Have some empathy.

451
43:16.900 --> 43:18.370
We're all human beings, please.

452
43:18.410 --> 43:19.880
It's a whole fifty thousand!

453
43:20.400 --> 43:23.370
I'm so sorry, but I really cannot accept this.

454
43:23.440 --> 43:25.100
I feel uncomfortable taking it.

455
43:27.620 --> 43:29.010
What's going on? Who’s that?

456
43:30.640 --> 43:32.640
Just some nonsense from someone who is self-centered.

457
43:34.280 --> 43:37.560
Though, even if she is self-centered, at least she’s fair

458
43:38.090 --> 43:39.230
and straightforward.

459
43:39.490 --> 43:41.250
Hey... this kid.

460
43:44.900 --> 43:47.860
Oh my... Whose kid is this?

461
43:48.130 --> 43:49.090
Are they that rich?

462
43:49.140 --> 43:50.160
If it were me,

463
43:50.200 --> 43:52.280
a thousand baht would be okay!

464
43:58.080 --> 43:59.060
K’Kie?

465
44:04.600 --> 44:06.480
Yes, K’Kie.

466
44:06.810 --> 44:07.860
Hello, Nuan.

467
44:08.630 --> 44:10.630
Has she accepted the money yet?

468
44:14.320 --> 44:16.320
I'm so sorry, K’Kie.

469
44:16.380 --> 44:18.100
I tried my best,

470
44:18.140 --> 44:20.900
but the other side just keeps refusing.

471
44:20.950 --> 44:24.150
Nuan, why can't you even handle a simple thing like this?

472
44:24.830 --> 44:26.830
Go make her take the money, no matter what.

473
44:28.120 --> 44:31.170
Otherwise, I'm going to dock your salary.

474
44:37.680 --> 44:39.680
Oh, hanging up again!

475
44:41.650 --> 44:44.480
And if she refuses the money, what on earth does that have to do with me anyway?

476
44:45.020 --> 44:48.290
Wow... Nuan’s life is just awesome.

477
44:51.740 --> 44:54.940
Alright, every problem always has me to solve it.

478
45:00.100 --> 45:02.210
Even though you never registered your marriage with anyone.

479
45:02.690 --> 45:05.430
I know that even if you wanted to,

480
45:05.470 --> 45:07.430
nobody would want to register a marriage with you anyway.

481
45:08.570 --> 45:11.860
What kind of person are you? Anyone you marry just ends up dead.

482
45:12.760 --> 45:15.760
It should be called a wife-devouring destiny, that's more accurate.

483
45:16.180 --> 45:17.220
You are a jinx!!

484
45:41.620 --> 45:42.990
Was I fired?

485
45:44.230 --> 45:46.990
But I’ve always done a great job!

486
45:47.270 --> 45:49.270
I even traveled out of town for work

487
45:49.850 --> 45:51.340
and my performance has been solid.

488
45:51.670 --> 45:52.990
Why…

489
45:54.220 --> 45:56.410
I know, but it was necessary.

490
45:56.980 --> 45:58.440
The higher-ups gave the order.

491
45:59.140 --> 46:01.140
Given the way you behaved toward K’Pijika,

492
46:01.410 --> 46:03.110
we simply cannot keep you on.

493
46:06.380 --> 46:07.480
Oh, I see.

494
46:11.180 --> 46:12.860
So it was Kie's doing, right?

495
46:13.840 --> 46:16.980
You have to understand that we are a subsidiary under their group.

496
46:17.330 --> 46:18.980
When they give an order, I have to follow it.

497
46:20.230 --> 46:21.480
I'm truly sorry.

498
46:43.930 --> 46:45.670
Did Mom actually fire her?

499
46:46.110 --> 46:48.280
Kie was the one who brought her in to work here,

500
46:48.320 --> 46:50.400
but yet she could still do this to Kie.

501
46:50.660 --> 46:51.700
Why should we keep her around?

502
46:52.840 --> 46:56.440
But Mom, Kaew is a good worker,

503
46:56.810 --> 46:58.650
and she didn't break any rules.

504
46:59.280 --> 47:00.570
What do you mean didn't break any rules?

505
47:00.640 --> 47:02.280
If she could do that to a friend,

506
47:02.330 --> 47:04.590
what's left for the organization?

507
47:08.260 --> 47:11.860
And... does Kie know about this?

508
47:12.870 --> 47:13.850
No need for her to know.

509
47:14.440 --> 47:16.720
It's best to let her rest and clear her down in Hua Hin.

510
47:32.450 --> 47:33.580
I can't believe it.

511
47:33.610 --> 47:35.650
Even the star employee got ousted.

512
47:36.600 --> 47:38.510
I heard they had some kind of fallout with K’Kie.

513
47:38.790 --> 47:41.380
Seriously? Best friends turning on each other?

514
47:41.420 --> 47:42.810
That's so intense!

515
47:44.370 --> 47:46.960
But who knows how it went down,

516
47:47.010 --> 47:48.670
it must've been pretty intense though.

517
47:48.890 --> 47:51.150
To get suddenly ousted like that out of nowhere,

518
47:51.190 --> 47:53.930
the situation definitely had to be serious, girl.

519
47:53.960 --> 47:55.380
Right? Exactly.

520
48:07.220 --> 48:08.060
Damn it.

521
48:47.880 --> 48:48.720
Excuse me!

522
49:18.230 --> 49:18.930
Here you go.

523
49:32.720 --> 49:34.400
Thank you truly, I really appreciate it.

524
49:34.940 --> 49:38.620
If you hadn't helped me, I would've been in a huge mess.

525
49:40.980 --> 49:42.180
It's no trouble at all.

526
49:43.100 --> 49:45.020
But when I went to catch you earlier,

527
49:45.060 --> 49:46.570
your body felt burning hot.

528
49:47.230 --> 49:48.700
You should go see a doctor,

529
49:48.750 --> 49:49.840
just in case it's heatstroke.

530
49:51.680 --> 49:54.400
Oh, it's completely fine.

531
49:55.480 --> 49:57.910
I guess I was just a bit stressed.

532
50:01.600 --> 50:03.320
I suddenly lost my job,

533
50:06.860 --> 50:10.780
and my girlfriend just passed away.

534
50:52.450 --> 50:53.830
Thank you though.

535
50:57.410 --> 51:02.650
But come to think of it, I was feeling burnt out here anyway.

536
51:04.850 --> 51:06.320
Getting fired is actually a good thing,

537
51:08.110 --> 51:12.950
it might be a sign for me to start fresh.

538
51:21.220 --> 51:24.960
Besides, the only reason I got to work here was

539
51:25.880 --> 51:27.880
because a toxic friend pulled strings for me.

540
51:30.360 --> 51:31.680
A toxic friend?

541
51:34.770 --> 51:35.700
Yes,

542
51:36.740 --> 51:38.330
she stole my girlfriend.

543
51:39.590 --> 51:43.850
It's a good thing that a toxic friend like that is out of my life.

544
51:48.160 --> 51:49.850
It's good that you see it that way.

545
51:50.310 --> 51:52.990
Life has to go on, after all.

546
51:57.210 --> 51:58.230
Hang in there!

547
54:15.170 --> 54:17.570
The only good thing about her is her money.

548
54:18.700 --> 54:22.250
Her bedroom skills are totally dull.

549
54:23.470 --> 54:28.730
When you're with me, you don't have to fake an orgasm like you do with Kie.

550
54:31.590 --> 54:34.470
I really have to hand it to you when it comes to this stuff.
